// Measured 2026-08-30 from the manifest body on srv5 whose sha256 is the resolved identity above.
// The template, license and params digests are byte-identical to the 20b rows -- one family, one set
// of auxiliary blobs, deduplicated by the content-addressed half of the store. They are repeated
// here rather than shared through a common row because the closure is a fact ABOUT THIS MANIFEST:
// if upstream republishes 120b with a different template, this list must be able to say so without
// editing the 20b closure.
//
// FETCHABILITY, stated at the strength it actually has. Four of five are VERIFIED BY CONTENT: the
